ree times the speed: that's the pitch behind SWE-2 Flash, which Cognition shipped today less than a season after SWE-2 itself.\n\nThe claim worth checking is \"outperforms all American open-weight models on leading evals.\" That's Cognition's own framing, not https://t.co/CY7y03UBoq", "url": "https://x.com/stretchcloud/status/2118098713667047794"}, {"author_id": "348922445", "created_at": "2026-11-04T20:57:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118085234063442264"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/9p9cn7dYBd", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pavelsimo/status/2118085234063442264/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118084123793219584", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/9p9cn7dYBd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/9p9cn7dYBd", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pavelsimo/status/2118085234063442264/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118084178306592768", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/9p9cn7dYBd"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/9p9cn7dYBd", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/pavelsimo/status/2118085234063442264/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118084281356443649", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/9p9cn7dYBd"}, {"display_url": "x.com/pavelsimo/stat…", "end": 328, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/pavelsimo/status/2117725666091135246", "start": 305, "url": "https://t.co/f2lTvYu5ib"}]}, "id": "2118085234063442264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 246, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117725666091135246", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Day 7/100 of Inference Engineering\n\n&gt; picking up where i left off yesterday... here are the rest of my notes on chapter 4 of Inference Engineering:\n\n&gt; the book covers three main inference engines: vllm, sglang and tensorrt-llm. which one you pick depends on the model you're https://t.co/9p9cn7dYBd https://t.co/f2lTvYu5ib", "url": "https://x.com/pavelsimo/status/2118085234063442264"}, {"author_id": "207129301916520